WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:00.000 --> 00:01.000
MkvDrama.net

3
00:12.600 --> 00:14.440
(18+)

4
00:14.440 --> 00:15.960
(For viewers aged 18+. May contain inappropriate content)

5
00:15.960 --> 00:17.120
(including violence, sexual content, and profanity. Discretion advised.)

6
00:17.400 --> 00:18.840
(This series is fictional and has no connection)

7
00:18.840 --> 00:20.600
(to any real persons, places, organizations, or events.)

8
00:20.600 --> 00:21.760
(AI technology was used in certain scenes during production)

9
00:21.760 --> 00:22.400
(to help ensure safety during filming)

10
00:22.400 --> 00:23.000
(and to enhance the quality and realism of the visuals.)

11
00:23.800 --> 00:27.920
(Warning: This series contains attempted suicide, blood, and violence.)

12
00:31.440 --> 00:33.920
And this one is for my dad.

13
01:14.360 --> 01:14.760
Ken.

14
01:20.320 --> 01:21.560
I was so close.

15
01:23.360 --> 01:25.360
I nearly caught that villain.

16
01:26.800 --> 01:28.160
Why did you do that?

17
01:32.240 --> 01:33.560
That's no ordinary Nour.

18
01:35.600 --> 01:37.360
Your carelessness could get you killed.

19
01:40.840 --> 01:42.280
I was trying to protect you.

20
01:47.400 --> 01:48.160
Protect me?

21
01:50.840 --> 01:52.640
Aren't you just afraid that if he dies,

22
01:55.320 --> 01:58.840
you'll lose your chance to go back to your true love?

23
02:05.320 --> 02:07.200
Silence means yes, right?

24
02:11.480 --> 02:12.760
You still want to die.

25
02:17.200 --> 02:18.520
Everything I did

26
02:20.480 --> 02:22.120
means nothing to you, does it?

27
02:25.320 --> 02:26.360
I've

28
02:28.560 --> 02:30.160
tried everything

29
02:34.400 --> 02:36.440
just so I could live by your side.

30
02:42.360 --> 02:43.880
But you're doing everything

31
02:45.880 --> 02:47.640
just to die and leave me like this?

32
02:51.040 --> 02:52.880
You're so selfish.

33
02:58.120 --> 02:59.760
Do you remember what I told you?

34
03:01.760 --> 03:03.400
As long as I'm still alive,

35
03:05.240 --> 03:06.880
you won't get your wish to die.

36
03:08.840 --> 03:10.680
So I thought it might be better

37
03:14.360 --> 03:16.360
if I just died and ended it all.

38
03:21.120 --> 03:22.880
How much do you really understand about death?

39
03:27.160 --> 03:29.480
How many people you loved have died in front of you?

40
03:33.640 --> 03:35.400
You said I don't understand death.

41
03:36.240 --> 03:37.600
Don't underestimate me.

42
03:41.560 --> 03:42.680
Do I have to watch the people I love,

43
03:44.720 --> 03:47.160
the people around me, die one by one?

44
03:49.640 --> 03:50.160
Right now,

45
03:52.080 --> 03:54.120
only one person I love left.

46
03:56.760 --> 03:57.480
It's you.

47
03:58.760 --> 03:59.360
It's you.

48
04:04.080 --> 04:05.000
And you

49
04:06.840 --> 04:10.320
still want to get back at me by killing yourself?

50
04:13.600 --> 04:14.360
In the end,

51
04:16.480 --> 04:18.360
everyone leaves me.

52
04:39.000 --> 04:40.320
I should never have loved you.

53
05:05.120 --> 05:08.120
(A WeTV Original Series)

54
05:39.160 --> 05:41.720
=Nour= (WeTV Original)

55
05:41.720 --> 05:44.280
Can anyone explain all of this to me?

56
05:47.440 --> 05:48.520
All these mistakes

57
05:48.760 --> 05:51.200
are on Inspector Ken, sir.

58
05:54.240 --> 05:55.880
We lost Officer Pimfan

59
05:55.880 --> 05:58.080
because Inspector Kiran's plan wasn't detailed enough.

60
05:58.240 --> 05:59.840
- She too gave her life - Who's there?

61
05:59.840 --> 06:01.640
- complete the mission. - Someone help us!

62
06:01.640 --> 06:03.560
We're still investigating

63
06:03.560 --> 06:04.920
whether Dr. Jiratikarn

64
06:04.920 --> 06:06.760
was involved in Officer Pimfan's death

65
06:06.760 --> 06:09.000
and whether he was working with Chidtawan.

66
06:09.000 --> 06:11.400
I've assigned officers to keep Dr. Jiratikarn under surveillance

67
06:11.400 --> 06:12.840
in case anything suspicious comes up.

68
06:13.440 --> 06:14.320
As for Inspector Kiran,

69
06:14.320 --> 06:18.080
I'd like you to consider suspending him and investigating the matter, sir.

70
06:22.120 --> 06:24.720
I request permission to lead the team personally in arresting Chidtawan, sir.

71
06:25.360 --> 06:27.040
All right, Inspector James. You may lead the team.

72
06:28.480 --> 06:30.000
We must get Chidtawan,

73
06:30.000 --> 06:31.640
dead or alive.

74
06:33.560 --> 06:34.440
Understood?

75
06:35.200 --> 06:36.520
- Understood, sir. - Understood, sir.

76
06:38.240 --> 06:40.480
Phong, shut down the computer. Meeting adjourned.

77
06:48.720 --> 06:50.240
Are you sure you want to do that?

78
06:54.960 --> 06:55.600
That's the plan.

79
07:44.560 --> 07:45.280
Ji.

80
07:46.400 --> 07:48.320
Get up and have a bite, sweetheart.

81
07:49.800 --> 07:50.240
Hmm?

82
07:54.840 --> 07:56.680
I want to be alone, Mom.

83
10:19.720 --> 10:21.440
I'm never going to recover, am I?

84
10:28.720 --> 10:29.640
You already know the answer.

85
10:30.800 --> 10:31.440
Dr. Jirat.

86
10:40.000 --> 10:40.640
Yes.

87
10:43.920 --> 10:44.360
But

88
10:45.480 --> 10:46.640
I really can't accept it.

89
10:50.200 --> 10:52.400
You know I've hurt my family before.

90
10:54.400 --> 10:55.360
And look at me now.

91
10:56.120 --> 10:59.280
I've tried cutting my arm so many times, but nothing happens.

92
11:00.440 --> 11:01.840
There's not even a scratch.

93
11:06.640 --> 11:07.760
So what are you going to do next?

94
11:20.040 --> 11:21.360
I'd probably run far away.

95
11:25.720 --> 11:27.480
No matter how much I love my family,

96
11:30.520 --> 11:33.760
I understand now that I need to stay as far away from them as possible.

97
11:38.160 --> 11:38.840
What about Chita?

98
11:41.920 --> 11:44.040
He's the only one who can stay with you right now.

99
12:02.760 --> 12:03.640
Being with him

100
12:05.240 --> 12:06.160
makes me happy.

101
12:08.880 --> 12:10.080
I used to be happy.

102
12:13.680 --> 12:16.280
That was before I knew who he really was.

103
12:19.560 --> 12:21.760
Even now, I still can't believe someone like him

104
12:21.760 --> 12:23.320
could have killed so many people.

105
12:31.160 --> 12:32.400
You're not answering my question.

106
12:52.960 --> 12:53.720
I love him.

107
12:56.480 --> 12:57.280
I love him.

108
13:03.160 --> 13:04.280
I don't know either.

109
13:05.520 --> 13:06.960
Maybe I'll choose to stay with him.

110
13:09.080 --> 13:10.080
Because soon,

111
13:11.040 --> 13:12.680
I'll become a monster just like him.

112
13:24.400 --> 13:25.360
What about you?

113
13:33.920 --> 13:34.960
What are you going to do next?

114
13:36.640 --> 13:38.400
I heard you were suspended.

115
14:01.840 --> 14:03.200
I've lived far too long already.

116
14:11.760 --> 14:13.600
I hope you made the right choice.

117
14:21.440 --> 14:22.640
Can I ask you something?

118
14:26.040 --> 14:28.320
Have you ever thought that maybe staying alive

119
14:29.680 --> 14:31.400
could be the right answer?

120
14:44.640 --> 14:45.400
Of course.

121
15:10.800 --> 15:14.360
I can still picture myself dancing with him every New Year's Eve.

122
15:20.000 --> 15:25.640
I can picture James having more records than I've collected in 200 years.

123
15:25.880 --> 15:28.120
The soundtrack from this movie. I really love watching it.

124
15:29.960 --> 15:34.400
I can picture James and me being happy together every day.

125
15:34.480 --> 15:35.360
Okay, okay.

126
15:35.800 --> 15:36.720
Don't open your eyes yet.

127
15:40.280 --> 15:41.000
Ready?

128
15:41.480 --> 15:41.880
Mm.

129
15:42.120 --> 15:42.800
You can open your eyes now.

130
15:44.640 --> 15:45.480
What's this?

131
15:46.960 --> 15:47.920
It's behind you.

132
15:49.760 --> 15:50.880
When you're ready, turn around.

133
15:52.120 --> 15:54.320
Three, two, one.

134
15:54.720 --> 15:56.040
Turn around.

135
16:06.520 --> 16:07.240
This time,

136
16:07.880 --> 16:10.520
I brought you to see it up close, just like I promised.

137
16:16.960 --> 16:19.240
What? You're not happy?

138
16:20.800 --> 16:21.720
I am.

139
16:25.120 --> 16:26.680
Come on, let me take a picture for you.

140
16:34.800 --> 16:35.560
Let me take it.

141
16:37.520 --> 16:38.920
I learned from you.

142
16:50.320 --> 16:56.760
But I can also see our happiness coming to an end.

143
17:08.000 --> 17:09.120
Here.

144
17:09.880 --> 17:12.120
I made your favorite food.

145
17:12.720 --> 17:13.760
The best in the world.

146
17:17.240 --> 17:18.800
Are you sure you can travel like this?

147
17:19.800 --> 17:20.920
That's so sudden.

148
17:25.080 --> 17:26.920
Is that why you've been acting strange?

149
17:27.200 --> 17:29.800
Were you worried about me and afraid to tell me?

150
17:33.240 --> 17:33.720
Yes.

151
17:37.720 --> 17:39.480
Here, your favorite basil stir-fry.

152
17:41.880 --> 17:43.280
Eat plenty, sweetheart.

153
17:43.720 --> 17:44.480
Thanks, Mom.

154
17:48.120 --> 17:49.240
Let's eat.

155
17:52.240 --> 17:54.440
When you're over there, will you miss my cooking?

156
17:55.080 --> 17:55.800
Hmm?

157
17:57.000 --> 17:58.360
Of course I will.

158
18:07.600 --> 18:08.120
Oh.

159
18:08.760 --> 18:10.560
What's wrong, sweetheart?

160
18:12.800 --> 18:14.120
Why aren't you eating?

161
18:18.800 --> 18:19.920
The basil stir-fry is spicy, Mom.

162
18:22.920 --> 18:23.920
Burn a hole in your stomach

163
18:25.880 --> 18:28.480
He likes spicy food, so I have to make it his way.

164
18:29.440 --> 18:33.760
He's going to be there for a long time. He won't be back for a year, kid.

165
18:36.880 --> 18:37.920
It's really spicy, Mom.

166
18:38.880 --> 18:39.720
Spicy, spicy.

167
18:41.800 --> 18:43.880
Come try this. Want something mild?

168
18:43.880 --> 18:44.400
- Here. - Sure.

169
18:44.400 --> 18:46.440
- This'll help with the spice. - Why is the basil so spicy, Mom?

170
18:47.160 --> 18:49.200
Don't you like spicy food?

171
18:50.920 --> 18:52.160
Here, this will help with the spiciness.

172
19:24.040 --> 19:25.000
OK, nice.

173
19:49.360 --> 19:50.480
Your hands are covered in cuts.

174
19:53.120 --> 19:54.240
Don't worry about me.

175
19:55.360 --> 19:56.760
The more you worry about me,

176
19:57.720 --> 19:59.200
the harder it is for me.

177
20:00.840 --> 20:01.520
Of course I'm worried.

178
20:02.920 --> 20:04.160
You're not Nour.

179
20:05.720 --> 20:07.080
Your wounds won't heal that easily.

180
20:08.480 --> 20:09.600
What if I were Nour?

181
20:13.800 --> 20:16.160
If I could live a long life with you,

182
20:18.040 --> 20:19.240
would you change your mind

183
20:20.200 --> 20:21.920
and want to keep on living?

184
20:24.600 --> 20:25.640
Don't become like me.

185
20:28.440 --> 20:30.080
I want you to move forward

186
20:31.400 --> 20:32.720
and live a happy life.

187
20:37.520 --> 20:38.760
Live a happy life

188
20:39.560 --> 20:40.680
without you?

189
20:50.600 --> 20:51.280
I understand now.

190
20:55.560 --> 20:56.360
That mirror,

191
20:58.240 --> 20:59.680
no matter how hard I try to fix it,

192
21:01.160 --> 21:02.720
it can never go back to the way it was.

193
21:07.640 --> 21:08.880
But no matter what,

194
21:10.680 --> 21:12.000
I still want to keep it.

195
21:16.480 --> 21:18.040
Same with our relationship.

196
21:21.360 --> 21:23.400
No matter how broken it is,

197
21:26.200 --> 21:27.920
I still want to do everything I can

198
21:28.920 --> 21:30.520
to put it back together.

199
21:39.440 --> 21:42.120
But if you still won't change your mind and still want to die,

200
21:43.440 --> 21:44.880
I'm ready to understand your choice.

201
21:47.920 --> 21:49.240
Please understand me too.

202
21:53.080 --> 21:54.600
I can't just let you die

203
21:56.520 --> 21:58.440
without doing anything.

204
22:41.120 --> 22:41.760
Yeah.

205
22:47.760 --> 22:50.280
Let's make every moment count until the very end.

206
22:53.560 --> 22:54.040
Mm.

207
22:55.520 --> 22:56.280
I promise

208
22:58.000 --> 22:59.760
I'll never let you go.

209
23:12.160 --> 23:13.320
Stop crying.

210
23:13.920 --> 23:14.520
Come here.

211
23:16.040 --> 23:18.360
Come see how well I fixed the mirror.

212
23:21.840 --> 23:23.040
What do you think? Isn't it beautiful?

213
23:25.440 --> 23:26.640
I think your mirror looks nice.

214
23:28.800 --> 23:30.280
You really have great taste in everything.

215
23:38.960 --> 23:40.200
How's the packing going?

216
23:41.400 --> 23:42.200
Come sit here.

217
23:49.360 --> 23:50.560
Please take care of Mom for me.

218
23:52.520 --> 23:54.200
I've written down everything you need to do

219
23:55.440 --> 23:56.400
in this notebook.

220
24:01.680 --> 24:02.440
Whoa.

221
24:04.760 --> 24:05.800
That's a lot.

222
24:07.280 --> 24:08.880
Aren't you only going for a year?

223
24:10.680 --> 24:12.760
Come back and take care of it yourself.

224
24:16.640 --> 24:17.080
Nin.

225
24:22.720 --> 24:23.600
I'm sorry.

226
24:25.560 --> 24:26.400
Sorry about what?

227
24:28.280 --> 24:29.440
You got a scholarship.

228
24:31.680 --> 24:32.040
Just

229
24:33.520 --> 24:34.680
be happy, okay?

230
24:37.120 --> 24:39.720
From now on, whatever path you choose,

231
24:41.880 --> 24:44.760
I hope it leads you to a bright future.

232
24:56.880 --> 24:57.880
I'm sorry.

233
25:10.360 --> 25:11.720
I should've spent more time with you.

234
25:14.800 --> 25:16.640
I should've made more time for you.

235
25:18.320 --> 25:19.680
It's okay.

236
25:22.360 --> 25:23.560
But I've made my decision, Nin.

237
25:25.080 --> 25:26.040
For Mom and for you.

238
25:27.800 --> 25:29.120
I'm proud of you.

239
25:33.320 --> 25:35.080
From now on, you have to stay strong for Mom.

240
25:37.640 --> 25:38.520
Come here. Give me a hug.

241
25:39.440 --> 25:41.120
- Give me a hug. - Hey, no hugging for grown-ups.

242
25:42.400 --> 25:43.120
I'm leaving.

243
25:44.920 --> 25:45.440
Okay.

244
25:47.000 --> 25:48.400
I'm glad you're my brother.

245
25:50.880 --> 25:51.760
I'm glad too

246
25:52.440 --> 25:53.400
that you're my brother.

247
25:55.040 --> 25:55.840
I'm leaving.

248
26:31.280 --> 26:32.360
Don't cry, sweetheart.

249
26:33.520 --> 26:35.120
I was trying so hard not to cry.

250
26:36.960 --> 26:38.600
It's only a year, sweetheart.

251
26:57.920 --> 26:59.160
Your brother's got a stomachache.

252
26:59.360 --> 27:02.720
If he still hasn't gotten better, Rain'll take him to the doctor tonight.

253
27:04.320 --> 27:05.680
Don't worry, sweetheart.

254
27:39.400 --> 27:40.840
Take care of Mom for me, Nin.

255
27:41.760 --> 27:42.040
I will.

256
27:46.560 --> 27:49.800
I'll take good care of myself. Don't worry, sweetheart.

257
28:02.880 --> 28:04.080
Travel safe.

258
28:04.200 --> 28:05.280
Travel safe, sweetheart.

259
28:34.440 --> 28:35.120
Are you ready?

260
28:45.720 --> 28:46.480
I'm ready.

261
28:51.320 --> 28:52.320
At least

262
28:54.080 --> 28:55.480
my family is safe.

263
28:58.480 --> 28:59.280
I just wish

264
29:00.960 --> 29:02.640
I could be there to see my brother happy,

265
29:04.480 --> 29:06.640
to be there on his graduation day,

266
29:08.440 --> 29:10.120
and to see Mom smile.

267
29:17.880 --> 29:19.160
I really wish I could.

268
29:29.640 --> 29:31.040
You seem human today.

269
30:06.360 --> 30:07.360
I brought him here.

270
30:20.920 --> 30:22.160
Don't forget what we agreed on.

271
30:25.360 --> 30:26.520
Why did you help me that day?

272
30:30.720 --> 30:31.760
We are the same.

273
30:36.800 --> 30:37.960
I promise you

274
30:40.080 --> 30:41.680
I'll let you see Dr. Ji again

275
30:45.160 --> 30:46.960
if you give me what I want.

276
30:52.840 --> 30:53.880
What do you want?

277
30:56.560 --> 30:57.480
Nour like us

278
30:58.520 --> 30:59.600
don't want much.

279
31:06.320 --> 31:07.440
Kill me.

280
31:48.160 --> 31:49.080
What you're doing

281
31:52.160 --> 31:53.680
is good for you, isn't it?

282
32:10.160 --> 32:11.080
Hey, watch out.

283
32:18.680 --> 32:20.000
Do you think that just by dying,

284
32:20.680 --> 32:23.000
you can repay the life you owe your true love?

285
32:25.560 --> 32:26.440
No matter what,

286
32:28.080 --> 32:29.640
please don't turn me into a Nour.

287
32:39.360 --> 32:40.800
I'll find the culprit

288
32:41.760 --> 32:43.920
and the person who killed my father as soon as possible.

289
32:46.640 --> 32:48.480
Because I want to start living my life with you

290
32:50.000 --> 32:51.240
as soon as I can.

291
33:09.880 --> 33:10.760
Ken.

292
33:12.040 --> 33:13.240
That's enough.

293
33:15.000 --> 33:16.160
I'm begging you.

294
33:19.080 --> 33:20.040
Stop there.

295
33:22.480 --> 33:23.040
Go back.

296
33:24.040 --> 33:25.000
I'm not going back.

297
33:26.040 --> 33:28.280
I know you don't really want to die.

298
33:29.360 --> 33:30.320
I know.

299
33:31.320 --> 33:32.280
I can see

300
33:33.600 --> 33:35.000
that you're scared.

301
33:36.440 --> 33:37.440
You're scared

302
33:38.280 --> 33:39.160
of dying.

303
33:40.720 --> 33:41.800
You're scared

304
33:42.640 --> 33:43.800
of leaving me.

305
33:44.640 --> 33:45.760
You're scared

306
33:46.840 --> 33:48.680
that you won't get to live your life with me anymore.

307
33:50.240 --> 33:51.600
I can see it.

308
33:52.200 --> 33:53.480
Do you think I'm stupid?

309
34:01.720 --> 34:02.840
All this time,

310
34:04.080 --> 34:05.920
we've been so happy together, haven't we?

311
34:08.640 --> 34:10.040
You were happy with me.

312
34:12.240 --> 34:13.080
You smiled

313
34:14.280 --> 34:15.800
for the first time in hundreds of years

314
34:16.680 --> 34:17.560
because of me.

315
34:20.920 --> 34:22.160
And I was happy

316
34:27.320 --> 34:28.240
I know

317
34:29.240 --> 34:31.680
you've wanted to die for hundreds of years.

318
34:32.760 --> 34:34.880
But I made you change your mind, didn't I?

319
34:38.640 --> 34:39.880
I showed you

320
34:42.120 --> 34:44.400
that living like an ordinary human

321
34:46.160 --> 34:47.720
can bring so much happiness.

322
34:52.120 --> 34:53.800
Every time we danced together,

323
34:57.720 --> 34:59.320
you smiled so happily.

324
35:00.600 --> 35:02.560
You smiled from the bottom of your heart.

325
35:03.720 --> 35:04.840
And I saw it.

326
35:06.280 --> 35:08.400
Every time I ate the noodles you made,

327
35:11.280 --> 35:12.440
you'd secretly watch me

328
35:13.360 --> 35:14.480
to see if I liked them.

329
35:15.400 --> 35:16.960
And I really loved them.

330
35:20.960 --> 35:22.080
My life

331
35:23.280 --> 35:24.480
is just this simple.

332
35:24.800 --> 35:25.320
Ken.

333
35:31.080 --> 35:32.080
Just say it.

334
35:34.280 --> 35:36.040
Say that you want to live with me too.

335
35:49.760 --> 35:50.520
Move in.

336
36:01.200 --> 36:02.480
Let me finish this first.

337
36:19.360 --> 36:19.880
Chita.

338
36:21.200 --> 36:22.120
Hey, stop shooting!

339
36:36.800 --> 36:38.000
I said stop shooting!

340
36:40.680 --> 36:41.160
Run!

341
36:44.200 --> 36:44.640
Run!

342
37:01.480 --> 37:02.040
Chita.

343
37:06.760 --> 37:07.840
In this world,

344
37:09.680 --> 37:12.120
is there really somewhere we can live together?

345
37:18.000 --> 37:19.200
You don't hate me anymore, Doctor?

346
37:22.080 --> 37:22.840
I don't know.

347
37:25.040 --> 37:26.640
I just don't want you to hurt anyone,

348
37:28.000 --> 37:29.560
and I don't want anyone to hurt you.

349
37:38.920 --> 37:40.800
No matter how cruel the world is to me,

350
37:48.000 --> 37:49.080
I still have you,

351
37:50.840 --> 37:51.960
who has always been kind to me.

352
37:59.840 --> 38:01.960
But you've been lying to me all this time.

353
38:09.280 --> 38:10.480
Look at your legs now.

354
38:13.880 --> 38:15.760
The Chita I knew as a rescue worker,

355
38:20.680 --> 38:22.480
the Chita I knew as my assistant,

356
38:28.920 --> 38:29.480
or

357
38:36.960 --> 38:38.360
the Chita I knew as my lover,

358
38:45.760 --> 38:47.120
I don't know anything about you.

359
38:55.960 --> 38:56.520
Doctor.

360
39:00.480 --> 39:01.320
I am who I am.

361
39:03.600 --> 39:04.200
Chita,

362
39:05.400 --> 39:06.200
your Chita.

363
39:09.960 --> 39:10.640
Come with me first.

364
39:15.480 --> 39:16.600
Then I'll tell you everything.

365
39:21.880 --> 39:23.320
How can I trust you, Chita?

366
40:02.080 --> 40:06.360
(48 years ago, 1978 AD)

367
40:19.120 --> 40:19.800
What's wrong?

368
40:20.480 --> 40:21.320
My back is itchy.

369
40:23.120 --> 40:23.760
Scratch it for me.

370
40:27.760 --> 40:28.440
Where?

371
40:28.880 --> 40:29.640
On the right.

372
40:29.920 --> 40:30.960
Right.

373
40:31.560 --> 40:32.120
Here?

374
40:32.520 --> 40:33.760
You can use your hand.

375
40:41.440 --> 40:43.200
- You don't get it at all. - Sorry.

376
40:46.240 --> 40:46.960
Here?

377
41:05.160 --> 41:05.840
Athit.

378
41:06.280 --> 41:07.000
What?

379
41:07.880 --> 41:08.880
The clock

380
41:10.200 --> 41:10.800
stopped.

381
41:15.200 --> 41:16.080
This one?

382
41:25.800 --> 41:26.640
Is it good now?

383
41:26.920 --> 41:27.720
There.

384
41:55.160 --> 41:56.240
Can you promise me

385
42:02.480 --> 42:03.120
that

386
42:06.320 --> 42:08.040
you won't turn me into Nour?

387
42:13.280 --> 42:13.760
Of course.

388
42:16.120 --> 42:16.800
I promise.

389
42:30.120 --> 42:30.760
Athit.

390
42:31.040 --> 42:33.280
Should we buy more plants?

391
42:34.120 --> 42:34.520
Sure.

392
42:35.920 --> 42:37.600
How about putting one here?

393
42:40.640 --> 42:41.160
Mm.

394
42:42.440 --> 42:43.440
But

395
42:46.040 --> 42:46.800
look.

396
42:47.560 --> 42:48.680
It's blooming.

397
42:51.320 --> 42:52.480
We've been watering it for so long.

398
42:52.760 --> 42:53.360
It's beautiful, isn't it?

399
42:54.840 --> 42:55.720
It took so long to bloom.

400
42:58.160 --> 42:59.280
Turn and look at me.

401
43:00.360 --> 43:02.040
- Let me take a picture of you. - Hey, no.

402
43:02.040 --> 43:02.760
Come on.

403
43:03.280 --> 43:05.400
One, two, three.

404
43:09.520 --> 43:10.040
Sweet.

405
43:12.720 --> 43:13.480
Definitely sweet.

406
43:14.480 --> 43:15.440
- Let me see. - No.

407
43:16.880 --> 43:17.560
I'm not letting you see it.

408
43:17.560 --> 43:18.680
- Let me see. - No.

409
43:22.160 --> 43:22.760
Is it sweet?

410
43:28.040 --> 43:29.480
I like it. Do you?

411
43:31.080 --> 43:31.640
I do.

412
43:32.080 --> 43:32.680
Like the picture?

413
43:35.280 --> 43:36.400
Don't even ask.

414
43:54.440 --> 43:55.360
Why are you back so soon?

415
44:16.120 --> 44:16.920
Darn!

416
44:30.640 --> 44:31.240
Chita.

417
44:33.320 --> 44:34.080
Wait a second.

418
44:38.320 --> 44:39.440
Darn!

419
44:46.560 --> 44:47.120
Hey!

420
44:48.520 --> 44:49.200
Hey!

421
44:50.360 --> 44:51.560
Stay with me.

422
44:53.080 --> 44:54.280
Please be okay.

423
44:55.720 --> 44:56.560
Hey!

424
44:58.080 --> 44:58.640
Hey!

425
44:59.280 --> 45:00.760
Stay with me.

426
45:15.120 --> 45:16.040
I'm sorry.

427
46:57.320 --> 46:58.920
Ever since the day I was changed,

428
47:00.440 --> 47:02.040
I instantly knew I was special.

429
47:08.320 --> 47:09.320
Please don't.

430
47:09.400 --> 47:11.040
Please, I don't want to die yet.

431
47:11.320 --> 47:13.040
I don't want to die yet.

432
47:13.360 --> 47:13.840
Please.

433
47:16.200 --> 47:17.440
A flame fueled by vengeance for Nour,

434
47:22.560 --> 47:24.160
Not caring who they are,

435
47:24.880 --> 47:25.640
Or what they used to be.

436
47:26.960 --> 47:27.920
Just die.

437
47:35.480 --> 47:36.640
But then I met you.

438
47:42.440 --> 47:43.480
Come on, I'll help you.

439
47:44.240 --> 47:44.720
Hey!

440
47:45.960 --> 47:46.920
I'm sorry.

441
48:11.600 --> 48:12.760
It's okay. I'm used to it.

442
48:14.640 --> 48:15.400
It's going to be okay.

443
48:18.440 --> 48:19.680
I believe you'll get better.

444
48:29.560 --> 48:30.760
You understand me, right?

445
48:38.200 --> 48:39.600
Hey, you guys!

446
48:39.600 --> 48:40.600
MkvDrama.net
